# ============================================================
# WHITELIST gitignore.
# The Kenney "All-in-1" bundle was extracted into the repo ROOT, dumping many
# large folders (2D assets, 3D assets, Archive, Audio, Icons, UI assets, Goodies,
# Early access, Other, Overview.html, ...). Rather than chase each one, we ignore
# EVERYTHING at the root and re-include ONLY the actual project below.
# Assets we actually use are copied into game/assets/** (tracked, since game/ is
# re-included). The raw bundle is the source library and is never committed.
# ============================================================
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.claude/
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/TASKS.md
!/design/
!/game/

# --- Inside the project: Godot cache, imported assets, editor/OS junk ---
.godot/
*.import
export_presets.cfg
build/
.mono/
data_*/
mono_crash.*.json
*.tmp
*~
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
